00:05:05.791 --> 00:05:10.071
And so the way that I did it was I simply
went ahead and looked at all of the

00:05:10.071 --> 00:05:14.651
different images that I had, and I asked
the AI to extract out just the character.

00:05:14.651 --> 00:05:18.811
So in this case, I asked for the brawler
on the left-hand side for this image.

00:05:19.001 --> 00:05:22.721
I did also play around with
using this character, but I felt

00:05:22.721 --> 00:05:25.541
like he looked similar to this
